[*]
[*] GTKWave save file — cxl_lpddr5x_bridge randomized waveform-debug run
[*] Opened by `make gtkwave` / `make vlt-rand-gtkwave` (repo root).
[*] Loaded alongside sim/obj_dir_rand/waves.vcd (make vlt-rand, sim/sim_rand.cpp);
[*] groups the four valid/ready ports, clocks/reset/link control, and the
[*] status counters so the c2m and m2c paths read top-down. sim_rand.cpp prints
[*] cycle-stamped event markers (backpressure, link up/down, drain_done, error
[*] pulses) on stdout to help jump to the interesting region.
[*]
